    <item>
      <title>‘Pick Another Protein’ Makes Sense This Thanksgiving</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-25/-pick-another-protein-makes-sense-this-thanksgiving</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">268873d900bdc1125c3057f6</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Mississippi Republican Cindy Hyde-Smith’s response last February to a television reporter asking about the high price of beef — “You have so many proteins to choose from” — will go down as one of the great political own goals of all time. But the soon-to-be-former US senator’s statement was factually correct. There are other proteins to choose from, and the one that’s the focus of this week’s Thanksgiving festivities in the US remains pretty cheap.</description>
      <dc:creator>Justin Fox</dc:creator>
