      <title>Ukraine Has a Blueprint for Protecting Vulnerable Power Grids</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-25/ukraine-has-a-blueprint-for-protecting-vulnerable-power-grids</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">4075257730eaf171315ef4f9</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>“There are no rules anymore.” Jan Montell, who sits on the supervisory board of transmission operator Ukrenergo, is describing Russia’s escalating war against Ukraine’s power grid. He counts some 1,200 attacks against energy infrastructure since the start of September, or an average of about 14 every day. “This will be the worst winter by far,” he adds.</description>
